<title>UK: Sallie Mae sets $500 mln 3-yr callable bond.</title>
<headline>Sallie Mae sets $500 mln 3-yr callable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Student Loan Marketing Association (Sallie Mae) has launched a $500 million three-year bond via joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and Morgan Stanley International.</p>
<p>It will be priced to yield 39 to 40 basis points over U.S. Treasury notes at the New York open today.</p>
<p>The bond is callable after one year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
